    "updated_at": "2018-08-21T17:19:46Z",
    "body": "I don't think this is quite closed. There are a lot of spec citations left that do not use the same style. It would take a pretty big search to find them all, although it was good that we fixed that one.\r\n\r\nFor example, a lot of places say `the WHATWG X standard` whereas if they were using the uniform style they would just say `<cite>X</cite>`",
